 subject="Alternative: botan instead of crypton"
 date="2026-09-30T02:19:53Z"
 content="""
The botan flag allows avoiding the dependency on crypton, instead depending on botan which is free from LLM generated code and better supported. More info in the blog entry [no llm code](https://git-annex.branchable.com/no_llm_code/#index7h3).
"""]]
